card.statement:
Module $T(\lambda, \beta, \tau)$ is simple as a $\V_1$-module if and only if one of the following conditions holds:

- [(1)] $\lambda\notin \Z$ and $\beta+\tau\neq 0$;

- [(2)] $\lambda\in \Z$, $\beta\neq 0,1,-1$ and $\beta+\tau\neq 0$;

- [(3)] $\lambda\in \Z$, $\beta=0$ and $\tau\neq 0, 1, -1$;

- [(4)] $\lambda\in \Z$, $\beta=1$ and $\tau\neq -1$;

- [(5)] $\lambda\in \Z$, $\beta=-1$ and $\tau\neq 1$.
